            "snippets": [
              "# In Ongoing Trade Dispute, China Targets U.S. Soybeans\n#### Background- Prelude to Chinese Soybean Tariffs\nAt the time, Bloomberg News reported, “**China** is the biggest maker of solar panels and expressed displeasure at the move.”  Then, in February, **China** launched a probe into U.S. sorghum imports",
